        "Successful questioning: Aldwyn admits that one of the original heroes is still alive, but refuses to say which one.",
        "Chapter 2 - The Road That Is Yours",
        "Author: The road descends through fields powdered grey. At the first crossroads, four weathered signs point toward four truths. Misthaven waits west. The Whispering Woods darken the north. Ashtonia smolders east. The old dwarf-road sinks toward the Bone Peaks.",
        "{user_nickname}: A command tells me where someone wants me to go. A choice tells me who I am.",
        "GAME: Open the race-specific first journey. Every route later converges on Misthaven Port.",
        "ELF PATH - THE WOOD THAT REMEMBERS",
        "Author: The Whispering Woods do not greet travelers with birdsong. They greet them with remembered voices. Every tree is silver on one side and black on the other, as though dawn and midnight have agreed to share the forest.",
        "Sil'Vaneth: Stop. The roots know your blood, but the ash clings to your shadow. Name the promise that brought you here.",
        "{user_nickname}: I have no promise. Only questions.",
        "Sil'Vaneth: Then you are already carrying the most dangerous kind of promise.",
        "Author: Sil'Vaneth, guardian of the heart-tree, reveals a shard of dark gold trapped among its roots. It is the Second Crown Fragment, awakened too early by the failing seal.",
        "PLAYER CHOICE",
