        "Author: Ashtonia crouches beneath the volcano like a city listening at a locked door. Red light runs through cracks in the road. Demons watch from ruined towers, not attacking, only whispering {user_nickname} as if testing the sound.",
        "Mother Sereh: Do not answer the mountain when it uses your name. It only learns the names of doors it means to open.",
