        "Author: In the sealed furnace beneath the shrine, the First Crown Fragment floats above a circle of embers. Mother Sereh can bind it to a ward, or you can seize it before the Greater Demon arrives.",
        "PLAYER CHOICE",
        "Complete Sereh's binding ritual. [SOUL check; lower corruption.]",
        "Take the fragment by force. [MIGHT check; corruption +1.]",
