        "Reward: first_fragment=true. Demons begin hunting you by name; add one demon to future random encounters.",
        "HUMAN PATH - THE LIGHTHOUSE GUILD",
        "Author: Misthaven Port rises from the fog in tiers of wet stone, rope bridges, and lanterns. Its converted lighthouse shines inland, guiding adventurers toward danger rather than sailors toward home.",
        "Guildmaster Corvane Ashford: The summons is genuine. I wrote it. What I did not write was your name.",
        "{user_nickname}: Then who added it?",
        "Guildmaster Corvane Ashford: That is the question I am paying you to survive.",
        "Author: As a human, you are admitted without the usual trial. Corvane offers rank, equipment, and a place beside three early companions. His kindness is efficient, polished, and almost convincing.",
        "PLAYER CHOICE",
        "Accept Guild rank and funding. [guild_rank +1; trust_corvane +1.]",
        "Inspect the expedition ledger. [WITS check; discover missing reports were altered.]",
