        "DWARF PATH - THE SILENCE OF KARAG-DUR",
        "Author: The Bone Peaks are so still that your footsteps seem disrespectful. Beneath them waits Karag-Dur, a dwarven hold whose gates remain open and whose hearths remain cold.",
        "Ser Halbrecht: Living footsteps. I had forgotten the sound.",
        "{user_nickname}: You are a Skeleton Knight.",
