        "Author: Three figures wait beneath the contract board. The first is Bram Ironjaw, a dwarf sellsword with a shield wider than the table. The second is Lira Sunstroke, a human mage-apprentice expelled for reading three chapters ahead. The third is Captain Odessa Vray, a smuggler captain who speaks of the Guild with professional disrespect.",
