        "Gate IX - The Fellowship Vault",
        "Author: Murals, ledgers, and living echoes preserve the truth in writing.",
        "WAYS THROUGH",
        "Human: free access. Mage: read the sealed language. Others must use evidence, a traitor's key, or a companion's gift of a treasured memory..",
        "Chapter 12 - The Fellowship Vault",
        "Author: The last door opens onto a circular chamber. Four statues face a fifth empty pedestal. In glass cases lie the original contract, the broken weapons of three heroes, and seven years of Guild death records.",
        "{user_nickname}: They were not lost. They were delivered.",
        "The Traitor: They volunteered to save thousands.",
        "{user_nickname}: Did they know what they volunteered for?",
