        "{user_nickname}: That is not an answer.",
        "Author: For the first time, the traitor looks old. Not wicked. Not innocent. Merely exhausted by the machinery of a choice repeated too many times.",
        "PLAYER CHOICE",
        "Condemn the traitor and take the Crown. [truth_exposed=true.]",
