        "GAME: Final moral choice: reject the seat, accept it, conceal your plan, or invoke a class-specific solution. The chosen answer affects Phase Two of the finale.",
        "ACT VI - RETURN TO HERO'S OVERLOOK",
        "Chapter 14 - The Road Closing Behind You",
